## What QA v2 changed in the tests
- The AC1 and AC2 tests and the rebase unit test edited volts to 48, the volts a new project
  starts with (src/lib/store.ts:30). That edit changes only the stamp, so the volts half of each
  assertion could not fail. They now edit volts to 24 (VOLTS). Proof: mutants.log Q1-Q3.
- New test: a save that fails while the account is read again keeps its edit on screen, and the
  next save carries it (the !isClean() check when the read answers). Proof: mutants.log Q4.

